# Packages repacked from the pinned firmware into fw_picked/debs-build/.
#
# Trimmed to what the pipeline actually installs from fw_picked/ -- NOT the full
# UNAS package set. On trixie, samba comes from apt and ubnt-libvips42 is routed
# through `uos runnable install`, so the bullseye-only samba/lib*/python3-*/winbind
# pins are gone; the UNAS Pro internals (c2lib, emmcmond, libubnt, linux-image-*,
# unas-pro-*, unifi-assets-unaspro, nginx-rec, ulp-go, ustd, ...) are never
# installed by the conversion.
#
# ubnt-libvips42 is listed under its trixie name (ubnt-libvips42t64): the bullseye
# name does not exist in the UNAS2 6.0.9 image.
ubnt-libvips42t64
ubnt-libvips-tools
unifi-drive
unifi-drive-config
unifi-drive-rclone
unifi-rclone
wsdd
wsdd-server
